    <div class="container my-5">
      <p>
        <strong>Urban Panchhi</strong> is a creative studio specializing in unique
        home décor items, including <b
          >carpets, cushions, tapestries, curtains, table covers, pillow covers,
          and more.</b
        > With over <em>15 years</em> of expertise in <b
          >textile, carpet, home furnishing, and graphic design,</b
        > our team blends artistic vision with technical precision to deliver products
        that transform living spaces.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our journey began with a passion for art and design, evolving into a
        commitment to excellence in every aspect of home décor. At Urban
        Panchhi, we value creativity, smart work, and authenticity. Each
        collection is thoughtfully crafted, drawing inspiration from nature,
        contemporary trends, and innovative techniques to ensure every piece is
        both beautiful and functional.
      </p>
      <p>
        We pride ourselves on our ability to handle high-volume production
        without compromising on quality. Our specialized skills in repeat
        pattern design, screen printing, digital print designing, and CAD work
        enable us to process complex design ideas into flawless,
        production-ready products. Whether collaborating with clients or
        exploring new trends, our focus remains on delivering market-relevant,
        bold, and original designs.
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>
          At Urban Panchhi, we are dedicated to elevating interiors with décor
          that reflects individuality and style, making every home a unique
          expression of creativity.
        </b>
      </p>
